   "title": "弹窗外层内边距致底部安全区留白",
   "type": "preference",
   "content": "uni-app编译于`dist/build/mp-weixin/common/vendor.js`注入`addGlobalClass:true`使`src/App.vue`样式穿透至`uni-popup`内部。根因系`App.vue`将`padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom)`作用于`.uni-popup__wrapper.bottom`外层，致内容白卡片无法填充而露遮罩灰。",
